    {
      "claim": "No traffic advisory covers this trip window, so nothing in the bundle reduces the measured excess or supplies an amended optimal under POL-RD-03. The advisory artifact EV-ADVIS-09114-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and carries no payload — I disclose that impairment expressly — and its absence is itself citable. It leaves the driver with no exculpatory clause to invoke under POL-RD-08, and under POL-RD-13 an uncited traffic explanation carries no weight against the trace figure.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-09114-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}
